      <selections>
        <selection id="unit0" name="Marneus Calgar in Armour of Antilochus" type="unit" number="1">
          <profiles>
            <profile name="Marneus Calgar" typeName="Unit">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="M">6"</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="T">6</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="SV">2+</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="W">6</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="LD">6+</characteristic>
                <characteristic name="OC">1</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Codex Adept" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description">This unit gains Assault Doctrine (Combat Doctrines).
This unit gains Devastator Doctrine (Combat Doctrines).
This unit gains Tactical Doctrine (Combat Doctrines).</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Deep Strike" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description">When this unit ends an Ingress move, while this unit has the Deep Strike ability, the triggering unit can be set up on the battlefield more than 8" away from all enemy models.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Leader" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description">This unit gains the Leader ability.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Master Tactician" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description">During your Movement phase, until the start of your next Command phase, you can use this ability:
  - Select one friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES unit visible to this model that is within 9" of this model. Select one option of Combat Doctrines for that unit, in place of any already active.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Thunderhawk Insertion" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description">When declaring Battle Formations, you can use this ability, select one friendly unit with the GRAVIS, PHOBOS or TACTICUS keyword. That unit gains the Deep Strike ability.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Combat Doctrines" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description">At the start of your Command phase, you can use this ability, until the start of your next Command phase:
  - Select one (each can be chosen once per battle):
    - Assault Doctrine: When this unit is selected to make an Advance move, this unit is eligible to declare a charge even if it Advanced this turn.
    - Devastator Doctrine: Ranged weapons equipped by models in this unit gain [ASSAULT].
    - Tactical Doctrine: When this unit is selected to make a Fall Back move, this unit is eligible to shoot even if it Fell Back this turn; this unit is eligible to declare a charge even if it Fell Back this turn.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile name="Transhuman Strategist" typeName="Abilities">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Description">At the start of the battle round, while this model has the Transhuman Strategist ability and this model is the Warlord, you gain 1 CP.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
